               <code code="34089-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DESCRIPTION SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>A minimal, hand-built SPL-shaped document with only a
                  description section — no "SPL product data elements section"
                  (LOINC 48780-1) at all. Some product types legitimately omit it;
                  IngredientExtractor must return an empty list, not raise.</paragraph>
               </text>
